# The additional cost must be a creature: with only Mox Jet (an artifact, not a creature) and a Swamp for {B}, Village Rites is
# rolled back; once an Ornithopter (an artifact creature) is in play the same cast succeeds and sacrifices it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Village Rites
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Village Rites.Cast
? Bot1.Mana = {B}
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet
? Bot1.Hand.Village Rites.Colors = Black
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Village Rites.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard = Village Rites; Ornithopter
